{
  "about": "A named intermediate that writes pivot exposes each listed value of one donor field as a field of its selection (LOOKUP-28, #4310). Match and narrow run as for any lookup; each listed name then selects among the candidates whose name equals it, by order_by and keep or nearest, and answers absence on its own, counted under the read's absent and multiple_matches handlers (LOOKUP-24, LOOKUP-14). Two candidates of one name with no selection fail as multiple_matches naming the field (LOOKUP-10), and a candidate whose name is not listed, a missing name included, fails the read as unlisted_pivot_name, unless the filter removes it. A pivot declares none on a row driver (ROW-2), and a pivoted plain lookup copies a Predecessor whose description names the value field with a where clause, the pivot standing as the condition (SUB-19, SUB-20). Every value is authored from those rules: A's second event has no site, B's first event has no cause, and A's weight on day 8 is the last of two and the one nearest a reference two days from it.",
  "documents": {
    "spec": "yamaa: \"1.0\"\ntype: spec\ndomain: TEST\nkeys: [SUBJ, SEQ]\ninput:\n  AE: {path: ae.csv, types: {SEQ: int}}\n  SUPP: {path: supp.csv, types: {IDVARVAL: int}}\nbase: AE\noutput: {path: out.csv, columns: [SUBJ, SEQ, SITE, CAUSE]}\nintermediates:\n  - id: QUAL\n    dataset: SUPP\n    key: {SUBJ: AE.SUBJ, IDVARVAL: AE.SEQ}\n    pivot: {name: QNAM, value: QVAL, fields: [SITE, CAUSE]}\ncolumns:\n  - {name: SUBJ, type: str, derivation: AE.SUBJ}\n  - {name: SEQ, type: int, derivation: AE.SEQ}\n  - {name: SITE, type: str, derivation: QUAL.SITE}\n  - {name: CAUSE, type: str, derivation: QUAL.CAUSE}\n",
    "selection": "yamaa: \"1.0\"\ntype: spec\ndomain: TEST\nkeys: [SUBJ]\ninput:\n  DM: {path: dm.csv, types: {REFDT: date}}\n  VS: {path: vs.csv, types: {DAY: int, VSDT: date, RESULT: float}}\nbase: DM\noutput: {path: out.csv, columns: [SUBJ, HEIGHT, WEIGHT]}\nintermediates:\n  - id: LAST\n    dataset: VS\n    key: {SUBJ: DM.SUBJ}\n    order_by: [VS.DAY]\n    keep: last\n    pivot: {name: TEST, value: RESULT, fields: [HEIGHT, WEIGHT]}\ncolumns:\n  - {name: SUBJ, type: str, derivation: DM.SUBJ}\n  - {name: HEIGHT, type: float, derivation: LAST.HEIGHT}\n  - {name: WEIGHT, type: float, derivation: LAST.WEIGHT}\n",
    "driver": "yamaa: \"1.0\"\ntype: spec\ndomain: TEST\nkeys: [SUBJ]\ninput:\n  AE: ae.csv\n  SUPP: supp.csv\nbase: AE\noutput: {path: out.csv, columns: [SUBJ, VAL]}\nintermediates:\n  - id: QUAL\n    dataset: SUPP\n    filter: \"SUPP.QNAM = 'SITE'\"\n    pivot: {name: QNAM, value: QVAL, fields: [SITE]}\ncolumns:\n  - {name: SUBJ, type: str}\n  - {name: VAL, type: str}\nrows:\n  - id: each\n    dataset: QUAL\n    derivations: {SUBJ: QUAL.SUBJ, VAL: QUAL.QVAL}\n",
    "predecessor": "yamaa: \"1.0\"\ntype: spec\nmodel: ADaM\ndomain: ADAE\nkeys: [USUBJID, AESEQ]\ninput:\n  AE: {path: ae.csv, types: {AESEQ: int}}\n  SUPPAE: {path: suppae.csv, types: {IDVARVAL: int}}\nbase: AE\noutput: {path: out.csv, columns: [USUBJID, AESEQ, AEXSITE]}\nintermediates:\n  - id: QUAL\n    dataset: SUPPAE\n    key: {USUBJID: AE.USUBJID, IDVARVAL: AE.AESEQ}\n    pivot: {name: QNAM, value: QVAL, fields: [AEXSITE]}\ncolumns:\n  - {name: USUBJID, type: str, label: Unique Subject Identifier, derivation: AE.USUBJID}\n  - {name: AESEQ, type: int, label: Sequence Number, derivation: AE.AESEQ}\n  - name: AEXSITE\n    type: str\n    label: Location Detail\n    derivation: QUAL.AEXSITE\n    submission: {origins: [{type: Predecessor, description: \"SUPPAE.QVAL where QNAM = 'AEXSITE'\"}]}\n"
  },
  "cases": [
